---
import ProsePage from "@/layouts/ProsePage.astro";
import { SITE } from "@/site.config";

const { contact, location } = SITE;
---

<ProsePage
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How Andreea’s Lab collects and uses your details when you use this website, the consultation form or WhatsApp."
  lede="Short version: this site collects almost nothing. The form collects your name, WhatsApp number and message so Andreea can reply. WhatsApp conversations happen on WhatsApp."
  updated="September 2026"
>
  <p>
    <strong>Sample text for review.</strong> This policy is a draft written for the layout review. It must be
    reviewed by a UAE-qualified adviser and by the licence holder at {location.hostClinic} before launch.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is run by {SITE.practitioner.fullName}, operating from a treatment room inside {location.hostClinic},{" "}
    {location.area}, {location.city}, {location.country}. Questions about this policy: {contact.email}.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect, and why</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Consultation request form.</strong> Your name, your WhatsApp number, what you would like help
      with, and the treatment page you were on. We use this only to reply to you. Please do not include
      medical details in the form. Those are discussed in person at your consultation.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>WhatsApp.</strong> When you tap a WhatsApp button, you leave this website and message Andreea on
      WhatsApp. Those conversations are handled by WhatsApp under Meta’s own terms and privacy policy, which
      you can read on WhatsApp’s website. Andreea keeps your conversation on her business phone for as long as
      you are a client and for a reasonable period afterwards.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Analytics.</strong> By default this site loads no analytics and sets no cookies. If analytics are
      turned on in future, this section will be updated to say which service is used and what it records.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Where your details are stored</h2>
  <p>
    Form submissions are received by Netlify, the company that hosts this website, and forwarded to Andreea.
    Netlify stores submissions on its servers, which may be outside the UAE. Andreea deletes form submissions
    once she has replied and, where you become a client, keeps only what is needed for your treatment record.
  </p>

  <h2>Your health information</h2>
  <p>
    Information about your health is collected only in person, at your consultation, and is kept by Andreea
    as part of your treatment record under the policies of {location.hostClinic}. It is not collected through
    this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under the UAE Personal Data Protection Law (Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021) you can ask what personal
    data we hold about you, ask us to correct it, ask us to delete it, and object to how we use it. To do any of
    these, message Andreea on WhatsApp or email {contact.email}. We will respond within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This site does not set cookies by default. The optional Google Map on the contact page loads only when you
    tap “Load the map”, at which point Google may set its own cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We will update this page when anything changes and show the date at the top.</p>
</ProsePage>
